<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan gold rates seen rising.</title>
<headline>Pakistan gold rates seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan gold rates are expected to rise slightly on demand from jewellers this week, dealers said on day.</p>
<p>One dealer said prices had been moving up for the past week on increased demand from jewellers during the current wedding season. Silver rates remained unchanged last week.</p>
<p>    Gold 24 carat in rupees per 10 grammes SUNDAY   Feb 24</p>
<p>							 4,895    4,783</p>
<p>    Silver per 1,000 grammes		   7,715    7,715</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
